# Accepted image findings, read by Trivy and validated by .github/scripts/check_trivyignore.py.
# Each entry is a '# reason: <why>' line directly followed by '<CVE/GHSA id> exp:<YYYY-MM-DD>'.
# A missing reason, a missing or past expiry, or a malformed line fails the scan. Accepted
# findings still appear in the job summary. Keep this empty unless no fixed version exists.
